The matcher in includes/functions.inc.php is adapted from stringmatchlen() in
Redis 7.2 src/util.c:
https://github.com/redis/redis/blob/7.2/src/util.c

Character-class ranges compare bytes as signed 8-bit values, matching Redis
7.0.12 and 7.2 on amd64 where char is signed. PHP ord() is unsigned, so the
adaptation subtracts 256 from bytes 128..255 before the range test. Equality
tests still compare raw bytes. Escaped class members never start a range.
